ackground check. Closing Date for Receipt of Applications Review begins immediately and will continue until the position is filled. Apply for Position SUNY Canton does not discriminate based on race, color, national origin, sex, gender identity, disability, or age in its education programs, services, and activities, including employment policies and practices. Human Resources Administrative Services Human Resources Forms Policies & Procedures Labor Contracts Ethics Guidelines Alternate Work Schedules  Top 34 Cornell Drive Canton, NY 13617 Admissions Students Faculty Academics Alumni Community Athletics Academic Programs | Tuition & Fees Brightspace | Financial Aid | Library | UCanWeb CLDIOI | College Assembly | Email | UCanWeb Catalog | Course Descriptions | Majors | Registrar Foundation | Reunion | Transcripts Directions | Police Academy | SBDC Fitness Center | Intramurals Stay Connected 315-386-7011 1-800-388-7123 © 2026 SUNY Canton | Web Accessibility | Privacy Statement | Non-Discrimination/Title IX"
